    "prompt": "Japanese manga illustration, bold black ink line art, cel shading, flat colors, screentone texture, a cute anime girl in sailor uniform at a vending machine, 7-Eleven store with green orange red striped sign, rainy Japanese street at dusk, power lines, a C-130 Hercules four-engine turboprop military plane flying low overhead, dramatic low angle composition, comic panel energy",
    "negative": "",
    "width": 1024,
    "height": 1024,
    "steps": 20,
    "guidance": 3.5,
    "filename_prefix": "comfyforge/anime"
